{"availability":"available","full":"neilivanorencia/auth-js-demo","name":"auth-js-demo","description":"Auth.js demo designed as a toolbox for authentication, containing code collection of reusable components, hooks, and utilities.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-01-02T03:18:57Z","updated":"2026-02-21T07:40:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://auth-js-demo.vercel.app/","topics":["authjs","next-auth","nextjs","toolkit","typescript"],"demo":"https://auth-js-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:41:01.842Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:41:01.842Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:41:01.842Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:41:01.842Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["alt=\"Appwrite\" src=\" alt=\"Next.js\" src=\" alt=\"React\" src=\" alt=\"shadcn/ui\" src=\" alt=\"Tailwind CSS\" src=\" alt=\"Typescript\" src=\" alt=\"Zod\" src=\"","Auth.js Demo is a simple, functional demo of some of the most important functionalities within Auth.js. Though it presents some of the capabilities of the library, the project's main purpose was to serve as a mini toolbox for authentication. It contains a collection of reusable components, hooks, and utilities to be integrated in some future projects. This demo also acts as a guide or reference for people to understand how Auth.js can be used in many real-world scenarios."],"features":["Login Form - A secure login interface for existing users checks the email and password against stored records. These must match one another and exist in the database. The form further checks the legitimacy of the email…","Registration Form - A user registration form with field validation for name, email, and strong password requirements, made possible by Zod for error handling.","OAuth Integration - Enables Google and GitHub login and signup to allow users to bypass manual data entry for a faster and more convenient experience.","Forgot Password - A password recovery feature that enables users to reset their account password if forgotten. The process includes verifying that the user is the legitimate owner of the provided email address.","Two-Factor Authentication - An extra layer of security requiring two forms of identification to access sensitive data or resources. Users can enable 2FA through the Settings page, where a verification code is sent to…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neilivanorencia/auth-js-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"102a889f88f4c5b6a41b08218f2cb3c4e4d50c026e73ee0418d29d5ae0a231f0","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:41:02.008Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:41:02.008Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"alt=\"Appwrite\" src=\" alt=\"Next.js\" src=\" alt=\"React\" src=\" alt=\"shadcn/ui\" src=\" alt=\"Tailwind CSS\" src=\" alt=\"Typescript\" src=\" alt=\"Zod\" src=\"","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neilivanorencia/auth-js-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Login Form - A secure login interface for existing users checks the email and password against stored records.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neilivanorencia/auth-js-demo/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"OAuth Integration - Enables Google and GitHub login and signup to allow users to bypass manual data entry for a faster and more convenient experience.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neilivanorencia/auth-js-demo/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"102a889f88f4c5b6a41b08218f2cb3c4e4d50c026e73ee0418d29d5ae0a231f0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neilivanorencia/auth-js-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:41:02.008Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-02-21T07:40:19Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neilivanorencia/auth-js-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22: